+        <details>
+          <summary data-i18n="q1">Which loaders and versions are supported?</summary>
+          <p data-i18n="a1">Vanilla, Fabric (including Legacy Fabric for 1.7.10–1.13.2), Forge (1.7.10+) and NeoForge (1.20.2+). Forge 1.12.2 and below and Legacy Fabric are still in testing. Quilt is not supported yet.</p>
+        </details>
+
+        <details>
+          <summary data-i18n="q2">Is the Discord status safe to use?</summary>
+          <p data-i18n="a2">It’s optional and off by default. It uses Discord’s official Social SDK to send Rich Presence to the Discord app on the same phone, with no Discord login, token or password involved. Turn it on in Settings > Display > Discord.</p>
+        </details>
+
+        <details>
+          <summary data-i18n="q3">Should I pick 64-bit or 32-bit APK?</summary>
+          <p data-i18n="a3">Choose 64-bit (arm64-v8a) for almost every phone made in recent years. Use 32-bit (armeabi-v7a) only on old 32-bit phones: game RAM is capped at about 1.2 GB and some renderers are unavailable.</p>
+        </details>
+        <details>
+          <summary data-i18n="q4">Do I need to own Minecraft?</summary>
+          <p data-i18n="a4">AmberLauncher doesn’t include or distribute the game. You need a legitimate Java Edition account to play online; offline accounts are for solo play.</p>
+        </details>
